<title>POLAND: LDA FEB NET RISES TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>LDA FEB NET RISES TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.16 vs   0.07</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.27 vs   0.12</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.27 vs   0.15</p>
<p> Sales		    2.93 vs   2.69</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.24 vs   0.09</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.41 vs   0.16</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.41 vs   0.23</p>
<p> Sales		    5.74 vs   5.07</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish printing house is Lodzka</p>
<p>Drukarnia Akcydensowa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
